  }
 ],
 "level_notes": {
  "0": "Pandoc (Haskell) is the only implementation; its reader is the de facto definition. The AST in pandoc-types is the shared data model of all readers/writers.",
  "1": "The User's Guide section \"Pandoc's Markdown\" is the reference; there is no formal spec. RFC 7764 §4 registers the Pandoc variant.",
  "3": "PLDB has no separate entry."
 },
